B.NF=new A.k2("03","Fabricz","Fabric Rootz is a Brooklyn-based clothing company that produces clothing made for the formal or informal fashionista. We also specialize in fast local delivery and customer satisfaction globally.",B.I_,B.ov,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.app.fabricrootz","https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fabricz/id6763974574")
